8.4 Diversion Prohibition. You may not engage in any transaction or activity
    that is designed to, or would reasonably be expected to, divert the
    Software or any Derivative Work to any person, destination, or end use
    prohibited by applicable export control or sanctions laws.

8.5 Record-Keeping. If you engage in any export, re-export, or
    international transfer of the Software or any Derivative Work, you must
    maintain accurate records of such transactions for a period of at least
    five (5) years, and you must make such records available to the Licensor
