     threatened breach of this License, including any unauthorized Commercial
     Use, any Prohibited Use, or any violation of the Network Use source
     disclosure obligation, may cause irreparable harm to the Licensor for
     which monetary damages may be an inadequate remedy. Accordingly, the
     Licensor shall be entitled to seek, on an urgent basis and without prior
