     (b) any Prohibited Use;
     (c) any violation of Article 4.7 (Network Use source disclosure);
     (d) any violation of Article 17 or Article 18;
     (e) any willful or repeated breach;
     (f) any breach that causes material harm to the Licensor or any third
         party;
     (g) any breach of Article 5 (Commercial Use Authorization), Article 6
         (Data Privacy and Security), Article 7 (Responsible AI Use), Article 8
         (Export Control), or Article 12 (Enforcement and Remedies).

12.5 Audit Rights. If you hold a valid Commercial Authorization, the Licensor
     shall have the right, upon reasonable prior written notice (not less than
