         of China, either party may instead elect, by written notice, to refer
         the dispute to the China International Economic and Trade Arbitration
         Commission (CIETAC) for arbitration in accordance with its arbitration
         rules then in effect, by three arbitrators (or one if the amount in
         dispute is below the threshold for a three-arbitrator tribunal), with
